    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "spring_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Well, a new year has arrived. Do you have a plan for what you want to accomplish this year?#$e#I feel pretty hopeful.",
      "translation": "Tak, dorazil nový rok. Máš plán, čeho chceš letos dosáhnout?#$e#Vidím to docela nadějně.",
      "sourceSHA256": "bff2e3e85d561867caa07307ab91e4d66ccb80c9471efee6816871104f99164d",
      "translationSHA256": "963674b228064e75b27adef44f9fc2119f95075edef6cdf7a440343d780026e1",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "spring_8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Now that winter's over, we've got lots of productive weather to look forward to.",
      "translation": "Teď, když zima skončila, se můžeme těšit na spoustu dnů vhodných k práci.",
      "sourceSHA256": "d0d60d3e34171851096379ab88104c997186c897159531c48e2ea2531b8b76db",
      "translationSHA256": "6628bed2c949468f6d9c7a127d244656c6321e9a8f783a095a5a3299a598975a",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "spring_23",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I hope you've been practicing your moves... tomorrow is the flower dance!",
      "translation": "Doufám, že máš natrénované kroky... zítra je Květinový tanec!",
      "sourceSHA256": "9612037f7c3ad79367ca03be3f66608fa95db2998278815184aeb1a8e5f8a443",
      "translationSHA256": "cddcc46462188d6219fc9c8eb57233edcbd9d2f67067a070303ea7adbfb65daa",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "summer_1",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Make sure you don't get a heat stroke, dear.#$e#Drink plenty of water and don't overwork yourself.",
      "translation": "Dávej pozor, ať nedostaneš úpal, miláčku.#$e#Pij hodně vody a nepřepracuj se.",
      "sourceSHA256": "3e6967a03dedb3eba553a1e5a958cb364aa12b5c62009a3cf18c033ba79fd639",
      "translationSHA256": "37d736b0c6c3cb78c028ab00e0960689fc002b68dfbe85b9249cde8441a2de5c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
