    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/MarriageDialogue",
      "key": "fall_8",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Winter's just around the corner. We need to double check the heating system, turn off the valves, and check all the insulation in the house.#$e#Don't worry, I'll take care of it all.",
      "translation": "Zima je za rohem. Musíme znovu zkontrolovat topení, zavřít ventily a projít veškerou izolaci v domě.#$e#Neboj, o všechno se postarám.",
      "sourceSHA256": "75af5dc432ac383d6c43bea844370e6e92a7ae3cdb22334b65f174f7f75ab8a6",
      "translationSHA256": "5271ffd486838faa8de998bda0a3e5c3ad301f2cb1a276e32b0888663cd62c5d",
      "reviewChecks": [
