      "key": "spring_Leah",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Don't forget to look for wild horseradish, leeks and dandelions while you're out there!",
      "translation": "Až budeš venku, nezapomeň hledat divoký křen, pórek a pampelišky!",
      "sourceSHA256": "1c2b6f998867b0f8c81c3891d7d59ebe438d7651c3870c50cd36536214067512",
      "translationSHA256": "85171ab13714e54853d28220698f8699d893d4996e7ddc5c4f7d607910ce6756",
